  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (B): Under AU-C 210, management''s willingness to provide written representations is a precondition for the audit. If management refuses to provide a representation letter, the firm should decline the engagement because this suggests an unwillingness to accept responsibility for the financial statements, which undermines the foundation for the audit.
