  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (A): Under AU-C 220, evidence of management''s lack of integrity is the most significant factor suggesting the auditor should discontinue the engagement. Management integrity is fundamental to the audit relationship because the auditor relies on management representations, and reliable evidence depends on management''s willingness to be truthful.
